description	"The Jedi Watchman

The Jedi Watchman class focuses on speed, stealth, and indirect attacks.

^2Weaponry:
- Lightsaber Staff
-- ^7Staff / ^3Yellow ^7Styles
-- Saber / Blaster Defense (1)
-- Blaster Deflect (1)
-- Attack-Defense (Q3)
- Blaster Pistol (2)

^6Inventory:
- Personal Cloaking Field (2)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump  (3)
- Push  (2)
- Pull  (3)
- Miraluka Sense (3)
- Mind Trick (3)
- Speed (3)
- Grip  (1)

^8Attributes:
- Force Sense Immunity
- Force Block (2)
- CTF: 35s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Force 'Disguise' (1) [Weapon Mode In Melee]

^2Strengths^7: Great array of Stealth skills. Particularly adept at closing distance between long range classes like the killbot and sniper.
^1Weaknesses^7: Poor saber skills and ill suited for assault combat."